. *---- 第 14 章：多重插补（rep78 有缺失）-------------------
. misstable summarize rep78 price mpg weight length
                                                               Obs<.
                                                +------------------------------
               |                                | Unique
      Variable |     Obs=.     Obs>.     Obs<.  | values        Min         Max
  -------------+--------------------------------+------------------------------
         rep78 |         5                  69  |      5          1           5
